# Vizemes Telegram

Julian/Alex forum topic **vizemes** (thread 165) on `alex-julian-briar`.

**Before any coding:** unanswered inbound → reply first.

1. `bash ~/.local/share/vizemes-carryon/turn_start_triage.sh` (exit 1 = triage required)
2. Read `~/.local/share/vizemes-carryon/msg-*.txt`
3. `send_file.py` with plain group-chat language (done / stuck / next)
4. `mark_handled.py <highest mid answered>`

